  "details": "I would like to have the ability to place where on my avatar the voice would come out of.  There are many cool puppet avatars that attach to your hand yet the voice comes out of the center of players head bone.  This throws off immersion. \nThis could be something that is added onto the avatar, as a component. and points to an empty game object.  If it's not present, it defaults to normal microphone placement.",
